Instruction on how you created the tools isolation for this product.
Please include platform you installed on, where you installed it, what
you copied where, etc.:

These are jars built with the Axis WSDL2Java tool and they are supposed to cover the WS-Provisioning and WS-Trust standards.
As far as I talked with Kraicho, these had been requested by Johan in order to claim support for these two Web Service standards.
Also, it had been expected that someone will provide an example but this never actually done it. However, to be safe, we will
continue to ship them for now incase some customer/bundler is using them.  The following files were checked into
adks/tivoli/tdi/6.1 in cmvc:

wsprov.jar
wstrust.jar
ws_schemas.zip

